// The Figma Make build of the store, published from Make to its own
// public address. Figma's Embed Kit has no /make/ type and the editor
// URL (figma.com/make/...) refuses to be framed, so the only route to a
// genuinely clickable embed is Make's own Publish action, which hands
// back a `<three-random-words>.figma.site` URL that needs no Figma
// login. Checked 2026-10-31: the published host sends no
// `X-Frame-Options` and no `frame-ancestors`, so it frames here
// cleanly. Set this to null to switch the whole section back off.
